{"id":"50c413de5f4365ba","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Height Restriction","display":"df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction — ZFC Tree11 Height Restriction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction — ZFC Tree11 Height Restriction","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction — ZFC Tree11 Height Restriction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"15016c1e1dd46781\" href=\"?note=15016c1e1dd46781\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree\">58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,T,\\Gamma,t,\\alpha,L_\\alpha\\in V\">\\(R,T,\\Gamma,t,\\alpha,L_\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\">\\(\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\)</span> (locally quantified extension-order witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (tree-order predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (level predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11HeightRestriction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11HeightRestriction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}height\\text{-}restriction}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree11HeightRestriction}_S(R,T,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sqsubseteq_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\\land(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists L_\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\\land L_\\alpha\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr))\\land\\forall t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(t\\in R\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists L_\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\\land t\\in L_\\alpha\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}height\\text{-}restriction}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree11HeightRestriction}_S(R,T,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sqsubseteq_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\\land(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists L_\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\\land L_\\alpha\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr))\\land\\forall t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(t\\in R\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists L_\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\\land t\\in L_\\alpha\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is exactly the union of the nonempty levels of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> indexed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The canonical level predicate replaces the undeclared sequence-length operator and obtains node heights from the explicit tree order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree","status":"resolved","id":"15016c1e1dd46781","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,T,\\Gamma,t,\\alpha,L_\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11HeightRestriction}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}height\\text{-}restriction}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree11HeightRestriction}_S(R,T,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sqsubseteq_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\\land(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists L_\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\\land L_\\alpha\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr))\\land\\forall t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(t\\in R\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists L_\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\\land t\\in L_\\alpha\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1654,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3789","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-height-restriction]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","15016c1e1dd46781"]}